# Records summary

The retention period for financial records is five (5) years after the end of the financial year [[cite:obs-832b3de0476b7c21ccd72430e4cc52797259e8b8 "Financial records are retained for five (5) years after the end of the financial year."]].

Backups of the records system are taken weekly and verified by restore [[cite:obs-b20110da46f30b0288da10abd713b31269f9f441 "Backups of the records system are taken weekly and verified by restore."]].
